{"id":"priblizitel_no","lemma":"приблизительно","pos":"adv","rank":2692,"glosses":["approximate, approximately, roughly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2a/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он приблизительно понимает её проблемы.","en":"He understands her problems more or less.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to understand","l":"понимать"},{"g":"her"},{"g":"problem","l":"проблема"}]},{"text":"В итоге приблизительно десять тысяч долларов.","en":"The total is approximately ten thousand dollars.","words":[null,null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,2,"in the end"],[3,5,"ten thousand"]]},{"text":"Она прожила там приблизительно пять лет.","en":"She lived there about five years.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to live, to outlast","l":"прожить"},{"g":"there"},null,{"g":"five"},{"g":"year","l":"год"}]},{"text":"Сколько это приблизительно будет стоить?","en":"About how much will it cost?","words":[{"g":"how much, how many"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"to cost"}]},{"text":"Они приблизительно одного размера.","en":"They are more or less the same size.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,null,{"g":"size","l":"размер"}]}]}